        <mxCell id="p3-38" value="How the factory is selected: 1) AppMain calls AbstractDAOFactory.getInstance(). 2) On the first call it reads config.properties and the key dal.factory. 3) It loads that class by name (Class.forName, asSubclass IDAOFactory) and creates one MySQLDAOFactory or MongoDAOFactory, kept as the single instance. 4) Every later call returns that instance. Changing dal.factory takes effect only after a restart." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="60" width="330" height="182" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
